{"seq":2,"slug":"spring-physics","title":"弹簧物理动效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/motion/spring-physics","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"弹簧物理动效\">弹簧物理动效</h1><p>把一个抽屉从屏幕外推进来，用 <code>transition: 300ms ease-out</code> 看起来还行——直到用户在动画播到一半时改变主意想推回去。这时固定时长模型就露馅了：要么生硬地从当前位置重新跑一段 300ms（速度突变、不连贯），要么直接跳变。真实世界的物体不会这样，它有惯性、能随时改向、会自然减速。要复刻这种手感，得换掉「时长 + 曲线」这套模型，用弹簧物理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>弹簧动画不再问「这个动画该持续多久」，而是把元素当成连在弹簧上的物体，由三个物理参数描述它如何运动：<strong>刚度</strong>（stiffness，弹簧多硬，决定加速快慢）、<strong>阻尼</strong>（damping，多大的「黏滞」阻力，决定回弹与停止）、<strong>质量</strong>（mass，物体多重，决定惯性）。给定这些参数和一个目标位置，运动轨迹由物理方程自然推导出来，没有写死的时长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Tween[&quot;时长+曲线模型 (tween)&quot;] --&gt; T1[必须指定时长]&#10;  Tween --&gt; T2[被打断时速度突变]&#10;  Tween --&gt; T3[无法继承手势速度]&#10;  Spring[弹簧物理模型] --&gt; S1[无需指定时长]&#10;  Spring --&gt; S2[可在任意点被打断且速度连续]&#10;  Spring --&gt; S3[天然继承手势初速度]&#10;  S1 --&gt; Use[手势驱动 / 可中断 / 拟真交互]&#10;  S2 --&gt; Use&#10;  S3 --&gt; Use\">flowchart TD\n  Tween[\"时长+曲线模型 (tween)\"] --&gt; T1[必须指定时长]\n  Tween --&gt; T2[被打断时速度突变]\n  Tween --&gt; T3[无法继承手势速度]\n  Spring[弹簧物理模型] --&gt; S1[无需指定时长]\n  Spring --&gt; S2[可在任意点被打断且速度连续]\n  Spring --&gt; S3[天然继承手势初速度]\n  S1 --&gt; Use[手势驱动 / 可中断 / 拟真交互]\n  S2 --&gt; Use\n  S3 --&gt; Use</pre><p>两种模型的适用边界很清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>tween（时长+曲线）</th>\n<th>spring（弹簧物理）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心参数</td>\n<td>duration + easing</td>\n<td>stiffness/damping/mass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时长</td>\n<td>必须指定</td>\n<td>由物理涌现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被打断</td>\n<td>速度不连续</td>\n<td>速度连续、自然改向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>继承手势速度</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>确定的状态转场</td>\n<td>拖拽回弹、可中断交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"弹簧背后的物理\">弹簧背后的物理</h2><p>弹簧运动由经典的阻尼谐振子方程描述。一个质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的物体，受到弹簧拉力（与位移成正比，系数为刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>）和阻尼力（与速度成正比，系数为阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>），其运动满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\ddot{x} + c\\dot{x} + kx = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7512em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7512em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个方程的解的形态由一个无量纲的「阻尼比」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta = \\frac{c}{2\\sqrt{mk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0376em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1778em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>阻尼比把弹簧分成三种典型行为：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 为<strong>欠阻尼</strong>，物体会越过目标来回振荡几次再停（典型的「果冻回弹」感）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 为<strong>临界阻尼</strong>，最快地不振荡地到达目标；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 为<strong>过阻尼</strong>，缓慢地、绵软地逼近目标（像在糖浆里移动）。微交互里大多希望接近临界阻尼或轻微欠阻尼——既利落又有一点点活泼的回弹。理解阻尼比，就能从「调参靠玄学」升级到「知道往哪个方向调」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么弹簧更适合交互\">为什么弹簧更适合交互</h2><p>弹簧的杀手锏是<strong>可被打断且速度连续</strong>。前面抽屉的例子里，用户中途改向时，弹簧动画只需把「当前实时速度」作为新一段运动的初速度，整个过程速度连续、毫无突兀——这是 tween 模型做不到的，因为 tween 的曲线是预先算好的固定轨迹。</p>\n<p>第二个杀手锏是<strong>继承手势速度</strong>。回想<a href=\"../input-gestures/touch-gestures\">触摸手势</a>里我们算出的松手瞬时速度，把它直接作为弹簧的初速度，元素就会像被甩出去的真实物体一样，带着你给它的劲儿减速归位。这让<a href=\"../input-gestures/drag-drop\">拖拽</a>的松手落位、轮播的惯性翻页、下拉刷新的回弹都获得了「跟手且自然」的质感，这正是固定时长动画永远做不到的。</p>\n<p>正因为这些特性，弹簧特别适合「由连续手势驱动」的交互，而<a href=\"css-transitions-animations\">CSS 过渡与动画</a>的固定曲线则适合「由离散状态切换触发」的转场。两者不是替代关系，而是分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在工程中使用弹簧\">在工程中使用弹簧</h2><p>浏览器原生的 CSS 没有内建弹簧求解器（<code>linear()</code> 缓动函数可以近似一条预生成的弹簧曲线，但不能实时响应打断），所以真正的弹簧交互通常借助动画库。2026 年 React 生态的事实标准是 Motion（前身 Framer Motion，2024 年底从 <code>framer-motion</code> 更名为 <code>motion</code>，当前为 v12）。据其官方文档，Motion 对 <code>x</code>、<code>scale</code> 等物理属性默认就用弹簧，对 <code>opacity</code> 等视觉属性用 tween，并通过混合引擎在 Web Animations API 与 JS 之间智能切换以兼顾性能与弹簧能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { motion } from &#39;motion/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;&lt;motion.div&#10;  drag // 开启拖拽&#10;  dragConstraints={{ left: 0, right: 300 }}&#10;  animate={{ x: target }}&#10;  transition={{ type: &#39;spring&#39;, stiffness: 300, damping: 30 }}&#10;/&gt;;&#10;// 松手后元素带着拖动速度，按弹簧参数自然回弹/归位\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { motion } from 'motion/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;motion.div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  drag // 开启拖拽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dragConstraints={{ left: 0, right: 300 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  animate={{ x: target }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  transition={{ type: 'spring', stiffness: 300, damping: 30 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 松手后元素带着拖动速度，按弹簧参数自然回弹/归位</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调参的实用直觉：刚度越高动得越快、越「急」；阻尼越低回弹越多、越「弹」；质量越大越「沉」、越有惯性。一个常见误区是把刚度调到极高想让动画「快一点」，结果配上低阻尼变成剧烈抖动——记住刚度和阻尼要配套调，盯着阻尼比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 走。需要警惕的是弹簧的实时计算比 CSS 过渡开销大，大量元素同时跑弹簧要留意性能，这与<a href=\"../practice/performance-jank\">性能与卡顿</a>和<a href=\"orchestration-sequencing\">编排与时序</a>直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>弹簧模型用刚度/阻尼/质量三个物理参数描述运动，时长由物理涌现而非写死</li>\n<li>运动遵循阻尼谐振子方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\ddot{x}+c\\dot{x}+kx=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7512em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7512em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，行为由阻尼比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定：欠阻尼回弹、临界阻尼最快不振荡、过阻尼绵软</li>\n<li>弹簧的两大杀手锏是「可被打断且速度连续」和「继承手势初速度」，这是 tween 模型做不到的</li>\n<li>它适合手势驱动、可中断的拟真交互；CSS 固定曲线适合离散状态转场，两者分工而非替代</li>\n<li>浏览器无原生弹簧求解器，React 生态用 Motion（前 Framer Motion，v12）作为事实标准</li>\n<li>调参盯阻尼比、刚度阻尼配套调；大量元素跑弹簧要留意性能——见<a href=\"../practice/performance-jank\">性能与卡顿</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"弹簧物理动效","id":"弹簧物理动效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"弹簧背后的物理","id":"弹簧背后的物理"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么弹簧更适合交互","id":"为什么弹簧更适合交互"},{"level":2,"text":"在工程中使用弹簧","id":"在工程中使用弹簧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CSS 过渡与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/motion/css-transitions-animations"},"next":{"title":"编排与时序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/motion/orchestration-sequencing"}}